00:04:27.724 --> 00:04:33.024
from Jared Moskowitz and Angie Nixon. North Carolina lawmakers, W.R.A.L. reported,

00:04:33.024 --> 00:04:37.744
are back in Raleigh for new votes in what it called the last days of full Republican control.

00:04:38.184 --> 00:04:44.164
The Supreme Court, Bitcoin Foundation reported, declined custodia bank's appeal over a federal reserve account.

00:04:44.564 --> 00:04:48.324
Two senior aides to Pierre Poiliever have joined the BC Conservatives

00:04:48.324 --> 00:04:53.144
and both told the Globe and Mail they wanted to go home, not that they had lost confidence in him.

00:04:53.564 --> 00:04:57.844
The Bank of Canada, the same paper reported, has opened the search for its next governor.

00:04:57.844 --> 00:05:03.204
Emergency rooms are overcrowded as flu climbs fastest in Alberta, British Columbia and

00:05:03.204 --> 00:05:03.624
Yukon.

00:05:03.964 --> 00:05:08.404
With Manitoba, the Northwest Territories and Quebec close behind, the Globe and Mail

00:05:08.404 --> 00:05:08.864
reported.

00:05:09.384 --> 00:05:15.284
Canadian authorities, the BBC reported, have arrested 12 suspects in a $4.5 million luxury

00:05:15.284 --> 00:05:20.784
car theft syndicate, Nigerians among them, and recovered 96 vehicles bound for West Africa.

00:05:21.344 --> 00:05:26.744
The Party Kibble-Kwaw government, CBC reported, is cutting executives at Sante Quebec, which

00:05:26.744 --> 00:05:32.244
has called a bureaucratic monster. Apprenticeships in the skilled trades, NPR reported, are drawing

00:05:32.244 --> 00:05:36.944
people from many backgrounds, including college graduates, while artificial intelligence feeds

00:05:36.944 --> 00:05:42.724
the argument over what a degree is worth. Vice Admiral Angus Topshi, Canada's military number two,

00:05:43.144 --> 00:05:47.724
told members of Parliament on Monday he is satisfied with how Sobs globalized surveillance jets

00:05:47.724 --> 00:05:53.084
were bought. CBC reported, he said the planes will feed an integrated continental defense network.

00:05:53.084 --> 00:05:56.524
That defense sits against capability concerns about the aircraft.

00:05:57.757 --> 00:06:02.517
Quebec's minority Party Kippechwa government wants a religious symbols ban stretch to elementary

00:06:02.517 --> 00:06:05.337
pupils, and it needs other party's votes to move it.

00:06:05.837 --> 00:06:10.517
Conservative leader Eric Dooham has left his door open. He said his party generally favors

00:06:10.517 --> 00:06:15.157
a secular society, and that the link to rules already on some public workers is a wish

00:06:15.157 --> 00:06:20.737
to push religious symbols out of public space, especially public institutions. He said conservatives

00:06:20.737 --> 00:06:25.277
feel uneasy when a young girl arrives at school in a veil. He would not pledge the votes.

00:06:25.637 --> 00:06:31.017
He wants the how, the person responsible, and the process before a clear stand. Liberals and

00:06:31.017 --> 00:06:36.437
Quebec solidaires have said they will vote no. Joe Ortona, chair of the English Montreal School Board,

00:06:36.857 --> 00:06:41.317
said rules on what children wear would cross a line and steal attention from real systemic problems

00:06:41.317 --> 00:06:46.837
in schools. Harini Civilinga of the Canadian Civil Liberties Association called it a new low

00:06:46.837 --> 00:06:49.497
and said people should share the association's outrage.

00:06:50.177 --> 00:06:54.677
Stephen Brown of the National Council of Canadian Muslims asked if Quebec would keep a child

00:06:54.677 --> 00:06:57.077
out of math class over a turbine or a kippah.

00:06:57.617 --> 00:07:01.957
The plan would go past the old coalition Avenir Quebec ban on symbols for some public

00:07:01.957 --> 00:07:04.677
workers, already challenged up to the Supreme Court.

00:07:05.137 --> 00:07:08.017
A ruling on Bill 21 is expected in the coming weeks.

00:07:09.049 --> 00:07:13.229
Traffic parrots seized by U.S. border agents are alive in care at the Bronx Zoo.

00:07:13.229 --> 00:07:17.809
